Hi Wang,

I do not understand why you are looking at https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/blob/master/inst/testfiles/Actiwatch.csv

That is a test file representative of one specific type of externally derived epoch data (Actiwatch), while your data is raw data in gravitational units. So that file is not relevant to you.

See https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/readmyacccsv.html for documentation on how to read custom csv files with raw (high resolution) data like yours.

Best,

Vincent

Dr. Vincent van Hees | Independent consultant | https://accelting.com/

