Dear all,
  I was using GGIR to process my Actigraph GT9X link data, which were all transformed into CSV data. There were 130 files. I put them in one folder "folder1". It seems that part 1-part 5 went all well, but something was wrong in the report part. It would be appreciated if someone could help me with this problem.

Here is my code:
